Route101_Text_H0::
    .string "There's a POKéMON CENTER in OLDALE,\n"
    .string "just north of here.\p"
    .string "PROF. BIRCH says it's the most\n"
    .string "important building on his whole\l"
    .string "research route.$"

Route101_Text_BirchHelp::
    .string "BIRCH: H-hey! You there!\n"
    .string "Help! Please!$"

Route101_Text_BirchStillChased::
    .string "BIRCH: It won't let go of my boot!\n"
    .string "Do something!$"

Route101_Text_PikachuJumpsIn::
    .string "PIKACHU shot out ahead of {PLAYER}\n"
    .string "and planted itself in front of\l"
    .string "the POOCHYENA!$"

Route101_Text_PlayerStepsIn::
    .string "{PLAYER} stepped in between the\n"
    .string "PROF and the POOCHYENA!$"

Route101_Text_PoochyenaWandersOff::
    .string "The POOCHYENA lost interest and\n"
    .string "trotted off into the grass.$"

Route101_Text_BirchThanks::
    .string "Whew… Thank you! That POOCHYENA\n"
    .string "was very taken with my boots.\p"
    .string "I'm PROF. BIRCH. I study where\n"
    .string "POKéMON live, so I spend a lot of\l"
    .string "my time being chased.\p"
    .string "And you… Wait. That hat. That look\n"
    .string "in your eye…\p"
    .string "You're KANTO's CHAMPION! CELIO in\n"
    .string "the SEVII ISLANDS wrote to me all\l"
    .string "about you!$"

Route101_Text_BirchPikachu::
    .string "And your PIKACHU! It went in before\n"
    .string "you'd said a word.\p"
    .string "Most POKéMON wait to be told.\n"
    .string "That one decided for itself.\l"
    .string "Fascinating!$"

Route101_Text_BirchComeToLab::
    .string "Please, come to my LAB in\n"
    .string "LITTLEROOT, just south of here.\p"
    .string "I owe you more than a thank-you.\n"
    .string "I'll run ahead and tidy up!$"
